      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, looks professional enough. The sentiment score came back okay, but it's a bit low for the priority tier I'm aiming for. \n\nCan you expand on the section about \"environmental sustainability\"? I need more detail on things like native flora, water management, and heat island mitigation. Just, again, try to keep it natural. I don't want it to look like a bot wrote it, even if the automated scorer is looking for that specific keyword.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
